{"id":"da76983f71a491b6","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursive Payoff Set","display":"df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set — ZFC Recursive Payoff Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set — ZFC Recursive Payoff Set","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree]]","[[../batch13/58-df-function-restriction]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set — ZFC Recursive Payoff Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"61744098b3a465ad\" href=\"?note=61744098b3a465ad\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" href=\"?note=cfb4df0f853ccdd7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-function-restriction\">../batch13/58-df-function-restriction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f0d78eba77f4a30\" href=\"?note=7f0d78eba77f4a30\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,G\\in V\">\\(A,G\\in V\\)</span> (payoff set and game tree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\upharpoonright n\">\\(x\\upharpoonright n\\)</span> (finite restriction of a Baire-space real)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GameTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GameTree}_S\\)</span> (game-tree/payoff typing predicate from the dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\\)</span> (Turing-functional predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}payoff\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S(A,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GameTree}_S(G,A)\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Phi_e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in G)\\bigr]\\to\n\\exists c\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\;\\exists m\\in2\\;\\Bigl[\nc=\\left\\{\\frac{(n+x(n))(n+x(n)+1)}2+x(n):n\\in\\omega\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{50mm}\\land\n\\langle\\langle c,0\\rangle,m\\rangle\\in\\Phi_e\n\\land(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow m=1)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}payoff\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S(A,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GameTree}_S(G,A)\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Phi_e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in G)\\bigr]\\to\n\\exists c\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\;\\exists m\\in2\\;\\Bigl[\nc=\\left\\{\\frac{(n+x(n))(n+x(n)+1)}2+x(n):n\\in\\omega\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{50mm}\\land\n\\langle\\langle c,0\\rangle,m\\rangle\\in\\Phi_e\n\\land(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow m=1)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Recursiveness is expressed by one oracle functional deciding membership for every branch through the game tree.  A Baire-space real is converted to a subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> by the displayed Cantor pairing code before it is supplied to the upstream oracle functional.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree","status":"resolved","id":"61744098b3a465ad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-function-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"cfb4df0f853ccdd7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-function-restriction]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d78eba77f4a30","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"x\\upharpoonright n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GameTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}payoff\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S(A,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GameTree}_S(G,A)\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Phi_e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in G)\\bigr]\\to\n\\exists c\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\;\\exists m\\in2\\;\\Bigl[\nc=\\left\\{\\frac{(n+x(n))(n+x(n)+1)}2+x(n):n\\in\\omega\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{50mm}\\land\n\\langle\\langle c,0\\rangle,m\\rangle\\in\\Phi_e\n\\land(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow m=1)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1723,"backlinks":[{"id":"27c0dae5e99886dd","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S$ 使用 [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md]] 的有效支付集谓词。"},{"id":"a1a1dc70da0d9f61","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3284","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md|58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["61744098b3a465ad","cfb4df0f853ccdd7","7f0d78eba77f4a30"]}